course: dictionary
lesson: 10266
title: Toothache, a pain in your teeth
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Toothache is a noun. It names a pain in or around a tooth. Read the word in parts: tooth and ache. An ache is a steady, dull pain, so toothache is the pain you feel in your teeth.
explain: Look at the clues in this sentence: «A bad cavity can cause toothache, an infection with a swollen face, and the loss of the tooth.» The words cavity, infection and swollen face tell you toothache is a serious pain that needs help. When you meet a new word, check the words around it.
explain: Do not guess and then forget. Swap in your meaning to test it: «I have a pain in my tooth» means the same as «I have toothache». If your meaning still makes sense in the sentence, you are right.
fact: Toothache is a pain in or around a tooth.
fact: Toothache is a noun, so you can write «a toothache» or «a terrible toothache».
fact: Tooth decay, a hole in a tooth called a cavity, is a common cause of toothache.
fact: Brushing twice a day and eating fewer sweets helps stop toothache.
fact: If you have toothache, see a dentist. Waiting can make the tooth much worse.
exercise: Toothache means what? | *A pain in or around a tooth | A problem with your eyes | A sore throat from a cold | A sweet treat from the dentist
exercise: «A bad cavity can cause toothache.» Which of these is a cavity? | A sweet in a paper bag | *A hole in a tooth | A kind of toothpaste | A cold drink
exercise: Which habit helps stop toothache? | Brushing once a month | *Brushing twice a day and eating fewer sweets | Never visiting the dentist | Eating more sweets
test: «A boy in Leeds hid his toothache for weeks.» Why did his tooth need taking out? | *He waited too long, so a small filling was no longer enough | The dentist had no tools at all | His tooth was painted with bright colours | He went to the dentist on the very first day
test: Which sentence uses toothache correctly? | Toothache walks to school every day | The toothache is in my ear | *I have a terrible toothache | I toothache my dog on Sundays
exam: A girl in Vancouver hid her toothache for months. What should she have done? | Waited until it went away on its own | Hid it for even longer | *Told a grown-up and seen a dentist | Stopped brushing her teeth altogether
